    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">FAQ</h2>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-sm md:text-base">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Who is this for?</h3>
          <p class="text-white/80">
            Bluzen is for people who feel distracted, overwhelmed, or stuck — and want a structured, practical way to change it.
            You don’t need a diagnosis. You don’t need to know what’s “wrong.”
            This is for anyone who wants better focus, better sleep, and more consistent control over how they think and feel.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Is this therapy?</h3>
          <p class="text-white/80">
            No — Bluzen is not therapy in the traditional sense. It’s a structured mental-health training system based on neuroscience,
            hypnotherapy, and cognitive tools. Therapy is designed to treat deeper or crisis-level issues. Bluzen is designed to help you
            run your mind better, build skills, and move forward. If we ever identify something outside the scope of this program,
            we’ll discuss options and signpost to appropriate services.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Do I need to be diagnosed or on medication?</h3>
          <p class="text-white/80">
            Not at all. Bluzen works for people with ADHD traits, people who feel overstimulated or unfocused, and people who simply want
            better habits, focus, or emotional control. Diagnosis and medication are not required. If you are diagnosed or on medication,
            Bluzen can usually sit alongside this as long as you’re stable and supported — it does not replace medical treatment.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">What if I miss a session?</h3>
          <p class="text-white/80">
            If you give notice, we’ll reschedule where possible. If rescheduling isn’t possible that week, you’ll receive a short plan and tools
            to stay on track until the next session. No momentum is lost.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Is my data private?</h3>
          <p class="text-white/80">
            Yes. All forms, notes, and recordings are stored securely and used only to support your work in Bluzen.
            Nothing is shared with third parties for marketing. You can request deletion of your data at any time,
            aside from basic records we may need to keep for admin and safety.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Can I pause or refund the program?</h3>
          <p class="text-white/80">
            You can pause your block at any time if something changes in your life.
            Refunds aren’t available once sessions begin, because your slot is reserved and personalised work starts immediately.
            If early on we both agree the program isn’t suitable, we’ll discuss options.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
